# Observability

Source of truth: `docs/OBSERVABILITY.md`.

- Use `log/slog` via `logger.Factory.Module(...)` only. Never `slog.New` / `fmt.Println` / `log.Println` in modules.
- Pass `context.Context` into log calls so `request_id` and related fields attach.
- HTTP: request ID middleware + request logging (WARN ≥ 500ms).
- Prefer domain helpers (`AIUsage`, `AuthEvent`, `CalendarEvent`, `SchedulerEvent`, `DatabaseQuery`, `WorkerEvent`).
- Never log passwords, JWTs, OAuth tokens, API keys, or secrets.
- Do not add Prometheus / OTel / Sentry until the observability doc says so.
